function sample(){const r=[];const examples=[['Salary · Acme Technologies',148000,'Salary','Income',1],['House rent',28500,'Rent','Expense',3],['Amazon India',4899,'Shopping','Expense',20],['Swiggy',680,'Food & dining','Expense',21],['BigBasket',3280,'Groceries','Expense',19],['Uber',420,'Travel & transport','Expense',18],['Airtel broadband',999,'Bills & utilities','Expense',17],['Netflix',649,'Entertainment','Expense',15],['UPI / RAHUL / 883421',2500,'Uncategorized','Expense',14],['Blue Studio · Project invoice',24000,'Freelance & business','Income',11],['Zerodha · Investment transfer',15000,'Investments','Transfer',8],['Starbucks',540,'Food & dining','Expense',22],['Myntra',3299,'Shopping','Expense',10],['Apollo Pharmacy',1250,'Health','Expense',12],['Electricity bill',1840,'Bills & utilities','Expense',6],['UPI / NEHA / 556012',1750,'Uncategorized','Expense',5]];for(let m=4;m<=9;m++)examples.forEach(([description,amount,category,type,d],i)=>r.push({id:`demo-${m}-${i}`,date:`2026-${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d).padStart(2,'0')}`,description,amount:Math.round(amount*100*(m===9?1:1+(i%3-.8)*(m%3)*.07))*(type==='Income'?1:-1),category,type,account:i%4===0?'ICICI · Savings':'HDFC · Savings',review:category==='Uncategorized',statementId:'demo'}));return r;}
const demoRows=sample();
function allRows(){return demo?demoRows:state.transactions}
function rows(){return allRows().filter(t=>(accountFilter==='all'||t.accountId===accountFilter)).filter(t=>period==='all'||(period.startsWith('fy-')?t.date>=`${period.slice(3)}-04-01`&&t.date<`${Number(period.slice(3))+1}-04-01`:t.date.startsWith(period)))}
async function api(path,options={}){let r;try{r=await fetch(path,{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store',...options})}catch{throw Error('Cannot reach the server. Check your connection and refresh before retrying.')}const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Unexpected server response. Refresh and retry.'}));if(!r.ok){const e=Error(data.error||'Request failed');e.status=r.status;e.data=data;throw e}return data;}
function adopt(data){state=upgradeAccounts(data.state);if(accountFilter!=='all'&&!state.accounts.some(a=>a.id===accountFilter))accountFilter='all';committed=structuredClone(state);revision=data.revision;updatedAt=data.updatedAt;if(data.user)viewer=data.user;demo=false;}
// While a save is in flight the page is inert and a pill shows progress (it fades in only if the save is not instant).
function lock(value){saving=value;$('#app').inert=value;$('#modal').inert=value;document.body.classList.toggle('saving',value);let pill=$('#busy-pill');if(value&&!pill){pill=document.createElement('div');pill.id='busy-pill';pill.setAttribute('role','status');pill.innerHTML='<span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>Saving to your account…';document.body.append(pill)}else if(!value)pill?.remove()}
async function save(action='Ledger updated'){if(saving)return false;lock(true);try{const data=await api('/api/ledger',{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({state,revision,action})});adopt(data);return true}catch(e){if(e.status===409&&e.data?.state){adopt(e.data);$('#modal').close();render()}else state=structuredClone(committed);toast(e.message);return false}finally{lock(false)}}
async function refresh(show=false){if(saving||syncing||transactionUI.isEditing()||preferencesUI.isEditing()||categoryUI.isEditing()||$('#modal').open)return;syncing=true;try{const data=await api('/api/ledger');if(data.revision!==revision){adopt(data);render()}if(show)toast('Your ledger is up to date')}catch(e){if(show)toast(e.message)}finally{syncing=false}}
async function boot(){try{adopt(await api('/api/ledger'));render();afterLaunch()}catch(e){if(e.status===401){location.replace('/login?next='+encodeURIComponent(routeURL()));return}$('#app').innerHTML=`<div class="connection-screen"><div class="brand" style="color:#173b32">ledger.</div><h1>${e.status===401?'Sign in to your ledger':'Your ledger could not load'}</h1><p class="sub">${esc(e.message)}</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/login" target="_top">Sign in or create an account</a><button class="btn" id="retry-load">Try again</button></div></div>`;$('#retry-load').onclick=()=>{$('#app').innerHTML=loadingHTML();boot()};}}
function toast(s){$('#toast').textContent=s;$('#toast').style.display='block';clearTimeout(toast.timer);toast.timer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').style.display='none',4500)}
function modal(title,body,foot=''){const m=$('#modal');m.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-head"><h2>${title}</h2><button data-action="close" aria-label="Close dialog">${icon('close')}</button></div><div class="modal-body">${body}</div>${foot?`<div class="modal-foot">${foot}</div>`:''}`;if(!m.open)m.showModal()}
function periodLabel(){return period==='all'?'All imported dates':period.startsWith('fy-')?`FY ${period.slice(3)}–${String(Number(period.slice(3))+1).slice(-2)}`:period;}
function periodPicker(){const [year,month]=istDate().split('-').map(Number),currentFY=year-(month<4?1:0),years=[...new Set([currentFY,...(period.startsWith('fy-')?[Number(period.slice(3))]:[]),...allRows().map(t=>Number(t.date.slice(0,4))-(Number(t.date.slice(5,7))<4?1:0))])].sort((a,b)=>b-a);const months=[...new Set([...(/^\d{4}-\d{2}$/.test(period)?[period]:[]),...allRows().map(t=>t.date.slice(0,7))])].sort().reverse();return `<div class="period">${icon('calendar',14)}<select id="period" aria-label="Reporting period"><option value="all" ${period==='all'?'selected':''}>All time</option>${years.map(y=>`<option value="fy-${y}" ${period===`fy-${y}`?'selected':''}>FY ${y}–${String(y+1).slice(-2)}</option>`).join('')}${months.map(m=>`<option value="${m}" ${m===period?'selected':''}>${new Date(m+'-15T00:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{month:'long',year:'numeric'})}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`}
function render(){hideChartTip();syncRoute();preferencesUI.apply();const count=allRows().filter(t=>t.review).length;const titles={settings:['Make Ledger yours.','Choose how your workspace looks and what it shows.'],titles:['Names you recognize.','Correct transaction titles and teach Ledger your naming rules.'],accounts:['Your bank accounts.','Add, update, and organize the accounts behind your money.'],investments:['Your SIPs and investments.','Every SIP and fund, matched to the money that left your bank.'],overview:['Your money, understood.','A little clarity for your financial life.'],transactions:['Every transaction, in place.','See the details. Connect the dots. Keep things organized.'],statements:['A home for your statements.','Bring your accounts together, one statement at a time.'],categories:['Everything in its category.','Make your spending patterns easier to understand.'],reports:['The bigger financial picture.','A clear, exportable summary of your cash flow.']};$('#app').innerHTML=`<aside><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="brand-name">ledger<span style="color:#b8d795">.</span></span></div><div class="workspace"><div class="avatar">P</div><div>Personal workspace<small>INDIA · INR</small></div></div><div class="nav-label">Workspace</div><nav>${['overview','accounts','investments','transactions','titles','statements','categories','reports','settings'].map(n=>`<a href="${esc(routeURL(n))}" data-page="${n}" aria-current="${page===n?'page':'false'}" aria-label="${n==='titles'?'Transaction titles':n[0].toUpperCase()+n.slice(1)}" title="${n==='titles'?'Transaction titles':n[0].toUpperCase()+n.slice(1)}" class="${page===n?'active':''}">${icon(n)}<span>${n==='titles'?'Transaction titles':n[0].toUpperCase()+n.slice(1)}</span>${n==='transactions'&&count?`<b class="badge">${count}</b>`:''}</a>`).join('')}<button class="nav-extra nav-add" data-action="capture" aria-label="Add a UPI message or a bill">${icon('plus',20)}<span>Add</span></button><button class="nav-extra nav-more ${['overview','transactions','investments'].includes(page)?'':'active'}" data-action="nav-more" aria-label="More pages">${icon('menu',18)}<span>More</span></button></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="privacy-card">${icon('shield',20)}<b>Your finances stay yours.</b>Your statements and transactions are saved privately to your account, across devices.</div><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">P</div><div>${esc(viewer?.name||'Personal account')}<small>Your private money space</small></div></div></div></aside><main><header><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span><strong>${page[0].toUpperCase()+page.slice(1)}</strong></div><div class="header-right"><button data-action="refresh" aria-label="Refresh ledger" title="Refresh ledger">${icon('transactions',16)}</button><span><i class="status-dot"></i> ${saving?'Saving…':'Synced to your account'}</span><button data-action="settings" title="Data & privacy" aria-label="Data and privacy">${icon('shield',17)}</button><div class="round">P</div></div></header><div class="content"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>${titles[page][0]}</h1><p class="sub">${titles[page][1]}</p></div><div class="actions">${['accounts','settings','investments'].includes(page)?'':accountPicker()+periodPicker()}<button class="btn capture-button" data-action="capture">${icon('camera',15)} Add bill or SMS</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="upload">${icon('plus',15)} Upload statement</button></div></div>${legacy?.transactions?.length?`<div class="demo-banner">${icon('upload',14)}<span>You have ${legacy.transactions.length} transactions saved in this browser from the earlier version.</span><button data-action="migrate">Move to my account ${icon('chevron',11)}</button></div>`:''}${demo?`<div class="demo-banner">${icon('spark',14)}<span>You're exploring a sample workspace. Upload a statement to make it yours.</span><button data-action="empty-start">Start fresh ${icon('chevron',11)}</button></div>`:''}<section id="page-content">${page==='settings'?preferencesUI.settingsPage()+pwaUI.card()+inviteUI.card():page==='titles'?preferencesUI.titlesPage():page==='accounts'?bankUI.page():page==='investments'?investmentUI.page():page==='overview'?overview():page==='transactions'?transactions():page==='statements'?statements():page==='categories'?categoryPage():reports()}</section><div class="footer"><span>Made for a clearer relationship with money.</span><span>${icon('shield',11)} Cloud database · INR · India</span></div></div></main>`;bind();}
function metrics(){const s=summarize(rows());return `<div class="metrics">${[['Total income',money(s.income,true),'arrow',`${rows().filter(t=>t.type==='Income').length} income transactions`],['Total expenses',money(s.expenses,true),'down','After refunds · excludes transfers'],['Net cash flow',money(s.net,true),'wallet','Income minus expenses'],['Savings rate',s.income>0?s.savings.toFixed(1)+'%':'—','leaf',s.income>0?'Of your income retained':'Add income to calculate']].map(([label,value,i,note],idx)=>`<div class="metric ${idx===3?'highlight':''}"><div class="metric-label">${label}<div class="metric-icon">${icon(i,15)}</div></div><div class="metric-value">${value}</div><div class="metric-foot">${idx===3?icon('spark',11):''}${note}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
// Money in and out over the last six months: hover or tap a month for the totals, click a bar for its transactions.
function chart(){const list=rows(),months=[...new Set(list.map(t=>t.date.slice(0,7)))].sort().slice(-6),sums=months.map(m=>summarize(list.filter(t=>t.date.startsWith(m)))),name=(m,o)=>new Date(m+'-15T00:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{timeZone:'UTC',...o});
 const body=months.length?groupedBars({labels:months.map(m=>name(m,{month:'short'})),titles:months.map(m=>name(m,{month:'long',year:'numeric'})),series:[{key:'Income',name:'Income',color:'#527d67',values:sums.map(x=>Math.max(0,x.income))},{key:'Expense',name:'Expenses',color:'#c7d8b5',values:sums.map(x=>Math.max(0,x.expenses))}],format:(v,compact)=>compact?short(v):money(v),label:'Money in and out each month',drill:(i,x)=>({month:months[i],...(x?{type:x.key}:{})}),footer:i=>`Net ${sums[i].net<0?'−':'+'}${money(Math.abs(sums[i].net))}`}):'';
 return `<div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Money in, money out</h2><p class="sub">Your cash flow over time</p></div></div><div class="chart">${body||'<p class="sub">Income and spending appear here once you import a statement.</p>'}</div><div class="chart-note">${icon('spark',11)} Transfers and investments are excluded. Showing up to 6 months. Click a bar to see its transactions.</div></div>`}
function breakdown(){const map={};for(const t of rows())if(['Expense','Refund'].includes(t.type))map[t.category]=(map[t.category]||0)-t.amount;return Object.entries(map).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1])}
function donut(){let groups=breakdown().filter(([,v])=>v>0),total=groups.reduce((s,[,v])=>s+v,0),top=groups.slice(0,4);if(groups.length>4)top.push(['Other',groups.slice(4).reduce((s,[,v])=>s+v,0)]);const palette=['#537864','#8aa27a','#bfca9b','#d5b98c','#e7e9df'],nameOf=n=>n==='Other'?n:catLabel(n),share=v=>Math.round(v/total*100);let offset=0;
 const rings=top.map(([name,v],i)=>{const len=v/total*314.16;const out=`<circle cx="70" cy="70" r="50" fill="none" stroke="${palette[i]}" stroke-width="16" stroke-dasharray="${Math.max(0,len-3)} ${314.16-Math.max(0,len-3)}" stroke-dashoffset="${-offset}"${markAttrs({tip:{t:nameOf(name),r:[{c:palette[i],n:'Spent',v:money(v)},{n:'Share',v:share(v)+'%'}],...(name==='Other'?{f:`${groups.length-4} smaller categories`}:{})},drill:name==='Other'?null:{category:name},col:i,key:true})}/>`;offset+=len;return out}).join('');
 return `<div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Where it all goes</h2><p class="sub">Spending by category</p></div><button data-page="categories" aria-label="View categories">${icon('more',18)}</button></div><div class="category-content${top.length?' kit-live kit-fade':''}" ${top.length?liveAttrs('Spending by category',true):''}><div class="donut-wrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="50" fill="none" stroke="#f0f2eb" stroke-width="16"/>${rings}</svg><div class="donut-label"><small>TOTAL SPENT</small><strong>${short(total)}</strong></div></div><div class="category-legend">${top.length?top.map(([n,v],i)=>`<${n==='Other'?'div':'button type="button"'} class="category-line" data-for="${i}" data-col="${i}"><i class="dot" style="background:${palette[i]}"></i><span class="name">${esc(nameOf(n))}</span><strong>${share(v)}%</strong></${n==='Other'?'div':'button'}>`).join(''):'<p class="sub">Your categories will appear here.</p>'}</div></div><div class="category-footer"><span>${groups.length} spending categories</span><button class="text-link" data-page="categories">View breakdown ${icon('chevron',11)}</button></div></div>`}
function reviewStrip(){const n=rows().filter(t=>t.review).length;return n?`<div class="review-strip"><div class="review-icon">${icon('spark',18)}</div><div><b>A little input. A clearer picture.</b><p>${n} transactions need your review to keep everything in the right place.</p></div><button class="btn" data-action="review">Review transactions ${icon('chevron',12)}</button></div>`:''}
function accountShortcut(){return `<div class="card account-shortcut"><div><h2>Your bank accounts</h2><p class="sub">${state.accounts.length?`${state.accounts.filter(a=>!a.archived).length} active · ${state.accounts.filter(a=>a.archived).length} archived accounts`:'Add an account to organize your statements and transactions.'}</p></div><div class="bank-actions"><a class="btn" href="/accounts" data-page="accounts">Manage accounts</a><button class="btn primary" data-bank-add>${icon('plus',13)} Add account</button></div></div>`}
function overview(){const parts=demo?{}:insightUI.parts,recent=()=>`<div class="card recent-transactions"><div class="table-toolbar"><h2>Recent transactions</h2><button class="text-link" data-page="transactions">View all transactions ${icon('chevron',12)}</button></div>${table([...rows()].sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date)).slice(0,5))}<div class="table-footer"><span>${rows().length} transactions across ${new Set(rows().map(t=>t.account)).size} accounts</span><span>All amounts in INR</span></div></div>`;
 return securityStrip()+accountShortcut()+metrics()+booksStrip()+transferStrip()+captureUI.inboxStrip()+reviewStrip()+`<div class="board-tools no-print"><button class="text-link" data-action="customize-dashboard">${icon('settings',13)} Customize dashboard</button></div>`+board('dashboard',{insights:parts.insights,cashflow:chart,categories:donut,netWorth:parts.netWorth,upcoming:parts.upcoming,categoryTrend:parts.categoryTrend,savingsTrend:parts.savingsTrend,tax:parts.tax,recent});}
// Cards in the order and visibility you chose with Customize (saved in your preferences); wide cards take the full width.
